# ★ Gloom's UI (2026-09-29): the FOLDER stays GloomsOverlays, for the same
# reason — renaming it would orphan every save file below.
# ⚠ DO NOT RENAME THESE TWO GLOBALS.
# The addon folder was renamed VibeOverlay → GloomsOverlays in Phase E. WoW keys
# SavedVariables off the FOLDER name, so the save files were copied to
# GloomsOverlays.lua alongside the originals (account level + 22 characters).
# Keeping the GLOBAL names unchanged is what lets those copies load as-is, with
# zero Lua migration — 12 characters ride non-Default profiles (Goldset/Empty)
# that live in the per-character file. Renaming these silently resets all of it.
# The old VibeOverlay.lua save files stay on disk as the rollback.
## SavedVariables: VibeOverlayDB
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: VibeOverlayDBChar

GloomsOverlays.lua
GloomsOverlays_Portraits.lua
GloomsOverlays_Pages.lua
